1
00:00:00,540 --> 00:00:02,880
(Transcribed by TurboScribe. Go Unlimited to remove this message.) All the kids hated school lunch.

2
00:00:03,700 --> 00:00:05,120
It was disgusting.

3
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:08,540
Sometimes they had mystery meat.

4
00:00:09,380 --> 00:00:12,460
Today, in particular, they had hot dogs.

5
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:15,600
The hot dog had a strange color.

6
00:00:16,540 --> 00:00:19,840
The bun was also hard and stale.

7
00:00:20,840 --> 00:00:22,000
The lunch was free.

8
00:00:22,760 --> 00:00:24,600
Most kids did not complain.

9
00:00:25,320 --> 00:00:27,100
It was not healthy, though.

10
00:00:27,860 --> 00:00:30,840
The students decided to form a petition.

11
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:34,540
They wanted healthier and fresher food.

12
00:00:35,320 --> 00:00:37,500
They gathered a lot of signatures.

13
00:00:38,580 --> 00:00:40,840
The school decided to listen to them.

14
00:00:41,660 --> 00:00:44,240
They added new items to their menu.

15
00:00:45,280 --> 00:00:48,320
They had salad and also yogurt.

16
00:00:49,180 --> 00:00:52,420
They took out the hot dogs and hamburgers.

17
00:00:53,280 --> 00:00:55,020
The kids rejoiced.

18
00:00:55,840 --> 00:00:58,040
The food was finally edible.
